  "prefLabel": "Res 7305.06 Protection of Natural Habitats",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Res 7305.06 Protection of Natural Habitats. No person shall remove or cut any plant or vegetation or damage any natural feature at any time, within the high-elevation protected wildlife habitat zones at Franconia Notch state park.\n\nSource. #10532, eff 3-1-14\n\nAPPENDIX",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/res7300.html"
